The '''Giant Mole''' ('''''Talpidae wysonian'''''{{CiteNPC|npc=Natural history quiz|quote=The Giant Mole (Talpidae Wysonian)|loc=Varrock Museum|notes=West wing, Display case #7}}) is a relatively simple [[boss]] found in the [[Mole Hole]] under [[Falador Park]].

The Giant Mole is notable for its guaranteed [[mole skin]] and [[mole claw]] drops, which can be traded to Wyson for [[Bird nest (Wyson)|unique bird nests]], one of the only sources of consistent bird nests. These nests may be [[crushed nest|crushed]], creating an ingredient for making [[Saradomin brew]]s. It is also the source of the [[immaculate mole skin]] unique drop, used in creating the [[gem sack]] or traded to Wyson for five unique bird nests.

Players may choose to pay {{NoCoins|25,000|c}} to fight the Giant Mole in an [[instanced]] area by the [[Spade (Mole Hole)|spade]] at the north-western entrance. This is reduced to {{NoCoins|12,500|c}} after claiming the rewards from the hard tier of [[Combat Achievements]]. This cost is further halved if the player is an [[ironman]].

Killing the Giant Mole once is a hard [[Falador Diary]] task.

